    "triggerCondition": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "觸發條件(遞迴):leaf(type 必填)或組合 all / any / not;欄位依 type 選用。time ★ atLeast(秒)、since{event,itemId?,targetId?,legIndex?,waypoint?};ownDistance ★ point|waypoint|target、lessThan/greaterThan(nm);ownHeading ★ greaterThan/lessThan(度,順時針扇區);ownSpeed metric sog|stw、lessThan/greaterThan(kn);ukc lessThan/greaterThan(m)|lessThanFractionOfDraft;xtd greaterThan(m)、side port|starboard|any;routeLeg atLeast|equals|passedWaypoint;zone id、inside;phase equals;event kind、itemId?、targetId?、count{atLeast};fault name、active;telegraph in|notIn;autopilot enabled;manual(永遠為假)",
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "time",
            "ownDistance",
            "ownHeading",
            "ownSpeed",
            "ukc",
